          .un_remark
            %h6#remark_2 Remark
            %p
              In view of this definition we may read the
              %a{:href => "#SequenceOfInclusionsOfCoefficients"} above
              sequence of morpisms of coefficient objects as follows:
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
